<title>THAILAND: Thai Financial Trust to issue debentures.</title>
<headline>Thai Financial Trust to issue debentures.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai Financial Trust Plc, a finance and securities firm, said on Wednesday it plans to issue debentures worth up to three billion baht ($116.3 million) to finance its business expansion.</p>
<p>The debentures will have maturity of no more than 10 years and be approved by the shareholders, Thai Financial Trust said in a filing to the Stock Exchange of Thailand.</p>
<p>Other details on the debentures will be considered later by the company's board, it said.</p>
<p>(US$1=25.8 baht)</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
